<title>THAILAND: Samart to sell stake to Malaysian firm.</title>
<headline>Samart to sell stake to Malaysian firm.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai telecommunication firm Samart Corporation Plc said it would sign an agreement on Monday to sell 14 million shares or a 20.12 percent stake in the company to a unit of Malaysia's Telekom Malaysia Bhd.</p>
</text>
